OOM Screenshot 8.png", "id": "1202494335071082", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618442_1202494338404415_1314104998578942016_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BQi4uA-tatYQ7kNvwHmIrMf&_nc_oc=Adpzd1SA_2Zf9Lac54_6GgfubAjuNXy4KqmlhzY0gW-9r0nmYzgZkrFPc4dIFRXXkSI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQS6TSDGISXYjH0f5ajB06IDY6AUEmJUmym3e5RU-4rXRQ&oe=6B086108"}, {"file_name": "PICKABOOM Screenshot 9.png", "id": "1534195114587820", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499617729_1534195117921153_8691084946846864449_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=X5semxGJkdIQ7kNvwE1Coit&_nc_oc=AdpieUl0GseW4Dcajnu2LaefgLCIwnVKN6PglYNEsNCfBeAx3eOxaqKkOKXlr1BvTPw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTlh69-kNlzoc1znH7HXRybDKGtGb2lsQE3lkLL5Wc5WQ&oe=6B086241"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Cover Landscape 1 2560x1440 1.png", "id": "684914040932095", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618910_684914044265428_2959950593095626719_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QArq1Iz0ztoQ7kNvwGQW0ls&_nc_oc=Adr5vXvP3MlL6_U8DfOfgr_sRIF1A4Ykcd6afcH1nXXGaDjZbe1N_Gk3VdcVWRUzNnM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRqo2gK7ZdC4J-JusBz2VQcBRgeWi1Vv4300P2Ufq1HYg&oe=6B085F2F"}, "display_name": "PICKABOOM", "keywords": ["survival", "naturaldisasters", "funny", "horror", "adventure"], "long_description": "# **PICKABOOM**\n\n# Survive Natural Disasters. Free-to-Play. Weekly Updates. \n\nEnter the explosive world of PICKABOOM, a **multiplayer VR survival game** where every match feels like the end of the world. Team up with your squad to survive floods, quakes, and freak storms before the next cataclysm hits.\n{24914414018221905}\n{1393192055699014}\n\nVisit the **Avatar Shop**, led by VR fashion designer George Hermano, and mix survival gear with outrageous couture. Limited-time \u201cdisaster collections\u201d drop weekly so you can look iconic while the planet collapses around you.\n{698296172970507}\n{775418032145060}\n\nFace terrifyingly **unique monsters** that evolve with every environment, from crawling cave dwellers to colossal storm wraiths. No two encounters are the same.\n{1839225910314692}\n{799801039502319}\n\nWith **weekly updates**, new maps, disasters, and gear drop constantly, keeping the chaos alive. Jump into public or private lobbies, push your friends into danger, or save them just in time.\n{1287406879811240}\n\nJoin our Discord community to test new disasters, play with devs, and help shape PICKABOOM\u2019s future!\n\ud83d\udc49 https://linktr.ee/pickaboomvr\n\n**EQUIP. ADVENTURE. BOOM! PLAY PICKABOOM!** \ud83d\udca5", "short_description": "Survive Natural Disasters in VR! Free-to-Play. Weekly Updates. \n\nTeam up with your squad to survive floods, quakes, and spooky monsters before the next cataclysm hits.\n\nUse your 3D printer to craft new weapons: your own tools decide if you survive\u2026 or not!\n\nNew disasters, maps, and gear drop every week."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.pickaboomvr.com/policy-privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Unity 6.2.1f1 + MQDH", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.pickaboomvr.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "644354873106712"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCU